{
  "key": 39269,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Wow, it’s not often that we\n",
        "get a challenger from Johto.\r",
        "I’m Brock, the Pewter Gym Leader.\f",
        "I’m an expert on Rock-type Pokémon.\r",
        "My Pokémon are impervious to most\n",
        "physical attacks.\r",
        "You’ll have a hard time inflicting\n",
        "any damage.\r",
        "Come on!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Your Pokémon’s powerful\n",
        "attacks overcame my\f",
        "rock-hard resistance...\r",
        "You’re stronger than\n",
        "I expected...\f",
        "Go ahead--take this Badge.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Boulder Badge from Brock!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: I really enjoyed the battle\n",
        "with you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\f",
        "I’ll give you the move Rock Slide, too.\r",
        "It can sometimes cause your foe\n",
        "to flinch.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: I really enjoyed the battle\n",
        "with you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\f",
        "I’ll give you the move Rock Slide, too.\r",
        "It can sometimes cause your foe\n",
        "to flinch.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: The world is huge. There are\n",
        "still many strong Trainers like you.\r",
        "Just wait and see.\r",
        "I’m going to become a lot\n",
        "stronger, too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Yo! Legend in the making! You look...\f",
        "really rocking.\r",
        "Are you battling the Gym Leaders\n",
        "of Kanto?\r",
        "They’re strong and dedicated people,\n",
        "just like Johto’s Gym Leaders."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Yo! Legend in the making! That Gym\n",
        "didn’t give you much trouble.\r",
        "The way you took charge was\n",
        "really inspiring.\f",
        "I mean that seriously."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00008",
      "en_US": "Pewter City Pokémon Gym"
    },
    {
